flowchart TB
  Users[Internet users] -->|HTTPS| ALB
  Users --> CF[CloudFront default TLS]
  CF -->|Signed OAC| S3[Private static S3]
  subgraph AWS[DEV or PROD account / ca-central-1]
    subgraph Primary[Primary VPC]
      subgraph Public[Public subnets / AZ A and B]
        ALB[ALB + regional ACM]
        IGW[Internet Gateway]
        NAT[NAT + EIP / PROD one per AZ]
      end
      subgraph App[Private application subnets / AZ A and B]
        EC2[frontsite / backoffice / webapi / gameapi]
      end
      ALB -->|8080 / app SG| EC2
      EC2 --> NAT --> IGW
      EC2 -->|5432| RDS[Isolated transactional RDS]
      EC2 -->|6379 TLS| Redis[Isolated Redis]
      EC2 --> S3EP[S3 gateway endpoint]
      EC2 --> SMEP[Secrets Manager interface endpoints]
      SMEP --> Secrets[Application secrets]
    end
    subgraph Secondary[Historical VPC]
      History[Isolated historical RDS / two subnet AZs]
    end
    EC2 -->|VPC peering / reciprocal routes / 5432| History
    S3EP --> Artifacts[Private artifact S3]
    EC2 --> CW[Centralized CloudWatch groups]
    ALB --> Logs[Private S3 access logs]
    GitHub[GitHub OIDC / protected environments] --> Roles[Plan and deployment roles]
    Roles --> State[Versioned encrypted S3 state + native locking]
  end
